Vosaic offers for FREE a new, easy to use, Java-driven streaming 
audio package.

Vosaic Rhythm streams GSM audio files over the Internet via
any Java-enabled browser at 12 Kbit/s, easily accomodated by
most dialups.  There is NO LIMIT on the number of audio streams
you can serve with Vosaic Rhythm, nor are there any cumbersome
plugins or players to download.  For best performance, users
should have browsers with Just-In-Time Java compilers, such as
Netscape Navigator 3.01.

The Vosaic Rhythm Studio allows you to author GSM files by
converting from WAV, AVI, AIFF, Sun AU or MPEG audio into
GSM format.

Jazz up your web pages with Vosaic Rhythm!  Check out the applet
and download the Rhythm package from
		http://www.vosaic.com

Enjoy!

The Tech Crew at Vosaic


