Linux Vendors wishing to be involved with Uniforum 97 should contact 
SoftBank Comdex, Sylvio Mandino at mandino@comdex.com  in order to 
reserve your booth in the Linux Pavilion.  

In addition people wishing to volunteer to help staff the Linux 
International booth at Uniforum, or help with the Linux Pavilion 
should write to comdex@li.org

Everyone else; Please come and attend Uniforum to meet your favorite Linux 
vendors face to face.  Just your presence alone counts, especially if
you make it a point to ask non Linux vendors for portations of their
