   XCd is a compact disc player that runs under X11. This is the
   successor to XCd 1.3. It has been completely rewritten in C++, and it
   now uses the Qt GUI from Troll Tech. Version 2.0 has the advantage of
   being easily adapted to the quirks of individual CDROM devices by
   creating a small interface class. See the class documentation included
   with the source for more information. Version 2.0 also looks a little
   cooler ;)
 
