     * Uses very little screen real-estate.
     * Auto-detects new disc, when placed into the drive.
     * Can auto-play the disc as soon as it is inserted.
     * Can auto-eject the disc when finished playing.
     * Only plays the tracks you tell it to, and stores the track list in
       a database.
     * Shuffle play of selected tracks.
     * Can repeat the entire disc (in either playmode).
     * Time display shows track elapsed/track remaining/disc elapsed/disc
       remaining.

