- -	Hidden local network, using 192.168.x.x reserved addresses
- -	Setting up split DNS
- -	NTP for time synchronization
- -	Squid for caching WWW/FTP proxying
- -	IP Masquerading for General-Purpose Internet Access
- -	Tunneling, if I have time
- -	Sendmail for mail
- -	Samba for file and print services to Win95
- -	A few security issues


