  �  http://www.psico.unipd.it/ildp/docs/HOWTO/INDEX.html

  Spanish translations are available at:

  �  http://lml.ls.fi.upm.es/~jjamor/

  �  ftp://luna.gui.uva.es/pub/docs-esp/

