the group has been silent since before Xmas. There's a bit of
a backlog, which will take a while to get done.  Sorry about
that. Let's hope Dan gets his computer working again soon.

The ugly news: Well, not so ugly, just a bit of statistics. In
the approximately one month that Dan moderated the group,
there were about 300 submissions, of which he approved about 150.

